From: ApprenticeGC <apprentice@giantcroissant.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Sep 2025 12:40:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ci): use repository owner for Docker registry auth
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Fix Docker pre-commit workflow authentication by using github.repository_owner
instead of github.actor to ensure consistent access to GHCR images.

🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .github/workflows/pre-commit-docker.yml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/pre-commit-docker.yml b/.github/workflows/pre-commit-docker.yml
index 98164ab..6ad2d6d 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/pre-commit-docker.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/pre-commit-docker.yml
@@ -24,7 +24,7 @@ jobs:
     container:
       image: ghcr.io/giantcroissant-lunar/pinto-bean/precommit:latest
       credentials:
-        username: ${{ github.actor }}
+        username: ${{ github.repository_owner }}
         password: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}
     timeout-minutes: 15
     steps:
